KARBAL YE TERE BAN ME KISKA YE GHAR LOOTA HAI.<br>
<br>
1. BARCHI KO BHAGAYA HAI ATHTHARA SAAL WALA. <br>
 EK TEER KO MILA HAI ASGHER SA BHOLABHALA. <br>
 ABBAS KE ALAM PAR DARYA NE HAAT DAALA.<br>
<br>
2. AKBAR KI LAASH LEKE SOOTI HAI NOUJAWANI. <br>
 MITTI MAY CHUPGAYI HAI ASGHER KI BE ZUBAANI. <br>
 SAJDE SE SHAI NE LIKHDI ISLAM KI KAHANI.<br>
<br>
3. DULHA BANA HUWA HAI WO LAADLA HASAN KA. <br>
 BARAAT SUNRAHI HAI NOUHA NAYI DULHAN KA. <br>
 LO GUL YE KAAM AAYA ZEHRA TERE CHAMAN KA.<br>
<br>
4. MOULA ALI KI BETI BE PARDA JAARAHI HAI. <br>
 SABRE HUSSAIN LEKAR QUTBE SUNARAHI HAI. <br>
 ABBAS KE ALAM SE AWAAZ AARAHI HAI.<br>
<br>
5. BHAI KI LAASH PAR HAI ZAINAB BEHAN KE NAALA <br>
 YEH TOU BATAO AB TOU AB KOUN HAI HAMARA. <br>
 JAATE HAI KARBALA SE HAFIZ QUDA TUMHARA.